{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"85279","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/85279","key":"MC-271109","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"24/Apr/24 11:13 AM","customfield_10050":"1226595","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p><b>Summary:</b><br>\nUpgrading a world from 1.20.4 to 1.20.5, inventories of trader llamas are shifted, with items lost which end up in invalid slots. Any item in the carpet slot is also discarded. This does not affect regular llamas, only trader llamas.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to reproduce:</b><br>\nYou can go straight to step 5 using this world: <span class=\"nobr\"><a href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110538\" title=\"2024-04-24_23-54-57_MC-271109.zip attached to MC-271109\" data-attachment-type=\"file\" data-attachment-name=\"2024-04-24_23-54-57_MC-271109.zip\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" data-media-services-id=\"68458792-8fad-4736-8f67-9be25805ee51\" rel=\"noreferrer\">2024-04-24_23-54-57_MC-271109.zip<sup><img class=\"rendericon\" src=\"/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif\" height=\"7\" width=\"7\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"></sup></a></span>.<br>\nYou can use the command to summon the trader llama to skip steps 2-4.</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/summon trader_llama ~ ~ ~ {Tame:1b,ChestedHorse:1b,Items:[{Slot:2b,id:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:egg\"</span>,Count:1b},{Slot:3b,id:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:fern\"</span>,Count:1b},{Slot:4b,id:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"minecraft:dirt\"</span>,Count:1b}]}</pre>\n</div></div>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Create a world in 1.20.4.</li>\n\t<li>Summon trader llama.</li>\n\t<li>Tame the trader llama.</li>\n\t<li>Equip the chest on it.</li>\n\t<li>Upgrade to 1.20.5.</li>\n\t<li>Look at the trader llama's inventory.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p><b>Observed results:</b><br>\nItems from the two lower slots disappeared, and from the third they moved to the lowest one.</p>\n\n<p><b>Expected results:</b><br>\nAll items will be saved.</p>\n\n<p><b>Screenshots:</b><br>\n1.20.4<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"110539_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110539\" title=\"image-2024-04-24-23-39-10-540.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"110539\" file-preview-title=\"image-2024-04-24-23-39-10-540.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110539?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110539\" filename=\"image-2024-04-24-23-39-10-540.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110539\" data-attachment-name=\"image-2024-04-24-23-39-10-540.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"78ba2174-73ca-4425-af02-9c5bb5d75951\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>\n\n<p>1.20.5<br>\n<span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"110540_thumb\" href=\"/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110540\" title=\"image-2024-04-24-23-40-13-974.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\" file-preview-id=\"110540\" file-preview-title=\"image-2024-04-24-23-40-13-974.png\"><jira-attachment-thumbnail url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110540?default=false\" jira-url=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110540\" filename=\"image-2024-04-24-23-40-13-974.png\"><img src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/110540\" data-attachment-name=\"image-2024-04-24-23-40-13-974.png\" data-attachment-type=\"thumbnail\" data-media-services-id=\"0859fa6e-b833-48a0-8afa-2de8612b7b81\" data-media-services-type=\"file\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\"></jira-attachment-thumbnail></a></span></p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"24/Apr/24 8:58 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/110538","id":"110538","filename":"2024-04-24_23-54-57_MC-271109.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] EVGENSYPERPRO","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Los_Angeles","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"24/Apr/24 1:55 PM","size":"1.11 MB","mimeType":"application/zip","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/110538"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/110539","id":"110539","filename":"image-2024-04-24-23-39-10-540.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/63ff4fa7314f50881381771b/44978883-9dc0-401f-9700-a4e05a9ef918/32"},"displayName":"[Mod] EVGENSYPERPRO","acti